\b ZenPlus Agent Installation and Data Collection Notice\b0\par
\par
ZenPlus Agent is enterprise monitoring software published by Zentryc. It runs in the background and collects the endpoint inventory, performance telemetry, diagnostics, and network activity configured by your organization.\par
\par
Install this software only on systems that you are authorized to manage. By continuing, you confirm that the agent may start with Windows, connect to the configured ZenPlus controller, and receive verified software updates from zentryc.com.\par
\par
The installer preserves enrollment and local agent state during upgrades. Uninstalling the application does not purge collected state unless purge is explicitly requested.\par
